# Seasoned Dungeoneer: "When this creature enters, you take the initiative" (the venture fetches a Forest), and "Whenever you
# attack, target attacking Cleric, Rogue, Warrior, or Wizard gains protection from creatures until end of turn. It
# explores." On turn 3 Dungeoneer (a Human Warrior) and Llanowar Elves (a Druid, no target for it) attack: Bot2's Elves
# may block Bot1's Elves but not the Dungeoneer, which has protection from creatures (CR 702.16), so Bot2 takes 3. The
# explore reveals a Forest, a land, which goes to its hand.

